I suggest being able to teleport directly to the up or down staircase,
if it has been located, by responding to the "teleport where" prompt
with < or > as appropriate.

This would reduce dramatically the number of keystrokes when moving up and
down through the dungeon -- which would be a big help to people playing
at 1200 and 2400 baud.


